// Draconic Tail (combat log line on each strike)
@26 = ~Draconic Tail~

// Acid Breath
@30 = ~Acid Breath~
@31 = ~Acid Breath

The Black Dragon Disciple exhales a 15-ft. long, 5-ft. wide line of acid, dealing 4d4 acid damage to all creatures in the line (save vs. Breath for half). The damage increases to 6d4 at level 7, 8d4 at level 11, 10d4 at level 17 and 12d4 at level 19, when the line also grows to 30 ft. long and 10 ft. wide. Allies in the line are affected.

Usable once per day, twice at level 7, three times at level 11 and four times at level 17.~

// Frightful Presence
@40 = ~Frightful Presence~
@41 = ~Frightful Presence

The Black Dragon Disciple radiates an aura of draconic menace. Enemies of a lower level than the Black Dragon Disciple within 15 ft. must save vs. Spell or be panicked for 2 rounds. Whether it succeeds or fails, a creature then becomes immune to this aura for 24 hours. Allies are not affected.

Using this ability turns the aura on; it can then be dismissed at will.~
@42 = ~Dismiss Frightful Presence~
@43 = ~Dismiss Frightful Presence

Turns off the Frightful Presence aura. It can be turned on again at will.~

// Draconic Wings (helmet slot item, and the innate abilities that spread / fold them)
@60 = ~Draconic Wings~
@61 = ~Draconic Wings

Leathery wings have torn free from the back of the Black Dragon Disciple. They take the place of a helmet.

STATISTICS:

Movement: +4
Armor Class: +2
Immunity to critical hits~
@62 = ~Draconic Wings

The Black Dragon Disciple spreads his draconic wings, gaining +4 movement speed, +2 AC and immunity to critical hits. The wings occupy the helmet slot.

Using this ability spreads the wings; they can then be folded at will.~
@63 = ~Fold Draconic Wings~
@64 = ~Fold Draconic Wings

The Black Dragon Disciple folds his wings and frees the helmet slot. They can be spread again at will.~

// Fight with / without the Bite (innate abilities that swap themselves)
@70 = ~Fight with the Bite~
@71 = ~Fight with the Bite

The Black Dragon Disciple bares his fangs: the bite takes the off hand again and gives one more attack per round, with the usual two-weapon penalties.

Using this ability summons the bite; it can then be dismissed at will.~
@72 = ~Fight without the Bite~
@73 = ~Fight without the Bite

The Black Dragon Disciple fights with his claws alone, which lets him benefit from Single Weapon Style. The bite can be summoned again at will.~

// High-level abilities (BG2:EE and EET)
@80 = ~Breathbloom~
@81 = ~Breathbloom

The Black Dragon Disciple exhales with the strength of an adult black dragon. A great bloom of acid bursts in a 20-ft. radius, dealing 20d10 acid damage to enemies and throwing them back; those who are not resisting are also knocked unconscious for 3 seconds. A successful save vs. Breath halves the damage and negates the other effects. Party members are not affected.

Range: long
Usable once per day.~
@82 = ~Wing Buffet~
@83 = ~Wing Buffet

The Black Dragon Disciple beats his wings with the strength of an adult black dragon. Enemies within 20 ft. take 1d8 crushing damage and are thrown back; they must also save vs. Spell at -4 or be knocked unconscious for 3 seconds. Party members are not affected.

Usable once per day.~
@84 = ~Insect Swarm~
@85 = ~Insect Swarm

Like a black dragon, the Black Dragon Disciple calls a swarm of venomous insects, spiders and centipedes from the swamp onto his enemies, without any casting time. For 3 rounds, enemies within 20 ft. of the target take 2 points of poison damage per second and have a 100% chance of failing to cast spells. There is no saving throw. Party members are not affected.

Usable once per day.~
@86 = ~Plant Growth~
@87 = ~Plant Growth

Like a black dragon, the Black Dragon Disciple makes the swamp plants burst from the ground in a 20-ft. radius. Creatures in the area must save vs. Spell at -10 or be entangled for 1 round: they cannot move and suffer a 2-point penalty to AC. Allies are affected, but not the Black Dragon Disciple himself.

Usable once per day.~

// Summon Black Dragon Turtle (HLA)
@88 = ~Black Dragon Turtle~
@89 = ~Acid Steam~
@90 = ~Summon Black Dragon Turtle~
@91 = ~Summon Black Dragon Turtle

The Black Dragon Disciple calls a black dragon turtle from the depths of the swamp to fight at his side for 1 turn + 1 round per level. It obeys him until the duration ends or it is slain.

Black dragon turtle: HP 220, AC -3, THAC0 1, 2 bites per round (4d8+4 piercing damage, +4 weapon). Three times per summoning, at most once every 3 rounds, it breathes a cloud of acid steam in a line 40 ft. long and 15 ft. wide, dealing 12d8 acid damage (save vs. Breath for half). Allies in the line are affected. The turtle is immune to acid, poison and fear.

Usable once per day.~

// Summon Black Draco-Sphinx (HLA)
@92 = ~Black Draco-Sphinx~
@93 = ~Roar~
@94 = ~Acid Breath~
@95 = ~Summon Black Draco-Sphinx~
@96 = ~Summon Black Draco-Sphinx

The Black Dragon Disciple calls a black draco-sphinx, a winged lion with the horns and the acid of a black dragon, to fight at his side for 1 turn + 1 round per level. It obeys him until the duration ends or it is slain.

Black draco-sphinx: HP 200, AC -2, THAC0 2, 3 attacks per round with its claws and fangs (2d8+4 slashing damage, +4 weapon). When it first sees enemies, it roars: enemies within 30 ft. must save vs. Spell at -2 or flee in panic for 2 rounds. Twice per summoning, at most once every 3 rounds, it breathes a line of acid 40 ft. long and 10 ft. wide, dealing 10d8 acid damage (save vs. Breath for half). Allies in the line are affected, not by the roar. The draco-sphinx is immune to acid, poison and fear.

Usable once per day.~
